COMMERCIAL SERVICES ADDENDUM
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

1. Open-Source Core vs. Managed Services
   The OpenClawMesh client library, P2P protocol, and SKILL.md specification
   are distributed under the open-source MIT license above.
   You may self-host, fork, and modify the software freely.

2. Bitcoin-Native Payment Gateway — Premium Access Plans

   The managed inference gateway (gateway/server.py) and official hosted relay
   infrastructure are commercial services, accessible via Bitcoin payment:

   ┌──────────────────┬──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┐
   │ Plan             │ Price (BTC equiv.)   │ Description                          │
   ├──────────────────┼──────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
   │ Free Demo        │ Free (3 requests)    │ 7-day evaluation key, 3 API calls    │
   │ Pro Monthly      │ ≈ €10 / month in BTC │ No quota limit; rate/capacity limits apply │
   │ Lifetime License │ ≈ €200 one-time BTC  │ Permanent access, all future updates │
   └──────────────────┴──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┘

   Bitcoin Wallet: bc1qwq8sll9vrl83lclyhha2gyncpd5275cdr2wul5

   Payment Process:
   a. Check the BTC/EUR rate and satoshi amount displayed by the gateway.
   b. Send the exact amount to the wallet above.
   c. Submit your email, plan, and txid through the portal.
   d. The gateway automatically verifies the transaction on-chain.
   e. After the required confirmation count, your API key is activated automatically.
   f. Keep the private status_token returned by the submission to check payment status.

   No account creation. No KYC. No third-party processors.

